ivity_icon\n\n###### Activity\n\nInsights are not available for the society\n\ndelivery_icon\n\nLeave at Gate not available for deliveries\n\n## Amenities\n\n partyhall_icon\n\n  Party Hall\n pool_icon\n\n  Swimming Pool\n gym_icon\n\n  Gym\n rain_water_harvesting_icon\n\n  Rain water harvesting\n lift_icon [...] To ensure a hassle-free living experience, our society offers 24x7 water supply and efficient lift services. We also provide open parking, closed parking, and visitor parking facilities to accommodate your vehicles and your guests'. Moreover, the society has a designated kids play area and kids pool, where your little ones can have fun and socialize with their peers.  \n  \nAt Agarwal Residency CHS, we value sustainability and are committed to conserving natural resources. That is why we have incorporated rainwater harvesting systems into our infrastructure, allowing us to contribute towards a greener environment.","score":0.79119295,"raw_content":null,"id":"874d10-06"},{"url":"https://www.goibibo.com/hotels/agarwal-residency-recently-renovated-hotel-in-visakhapatnam-4957506301809186670","title":"AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated Hotel Visakhapatnam","content":"Amenities of AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated · Restaurant · Lounge · Butler Services · Smoking Rooms · Smoke Detector · LAN.","score":0.7890553,"raw_content":null,"id":"45d961-07"}],"response_time":4.97,"request_id":"8e53a5ad-3c30-467d-9d32-f4c328160b55"}